	JMP	.+3 	/N - ADD TO NAME
	JMP I	FUNCTI	/TRY FOR FUNCTION
	JMP GVS1	/O - TEST FOR STRING
	TESTN
	JMP LOOKUP	/WAS A "."
MDOLR,	200-"$		/SHOULD NEVER RETURN HERE
