	SMA	CLA
	JMP GFND2	/NO SUBSCRIPT
	L7777
	TAD	PT1
	DCA	PT1
	TAD I	PT1	/GET SUBSCRIPT
	CIA
	TAD	SUBS
	SZA	CLA
